[175.846, "ms, is th\u001b[57G one r\u001b[64Gmaining slack,\u001b[79Gand I'm profiling\u001b[97Gt\u001b[100G load ph\u001b[109Gses to check\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe mmap page\u001b[17Gfaults\u001b[24Gand\u001b[28Gthe\u001b[32G\u001b[38;2;87;105;247mmemset\u001b[39G\u001b[39mon\u001b[42Gthe\u001b[46Gpacked\u001b[53Gbuffer.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mWarm-cache startup spends 28\u201330 ms zeroing a packed buffer that packing overwrites anyway, plus 52\u201365 ms packing from\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe mmap and about 5.5 ms zeroing the KV cache. I'm skipping that zeroing and\u001b[81Greading\u001b[89Gthe\u001b[93Gcheckpoint\u001b[104Gwith\u001b[109Gpread\u001b[115Gin\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BL2-sized\u001b[12Gchunks\u001b[19Ginstead,\u001b[28Gto\u001b[31Gavoid\u001b[37Gthe\u001b[41Gpage\u001b[46Gfaults.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m Warm startup is now roughly 71\u201380 ms for read-and-pack\u001b[58Gplus\u001b[63G5\u20138\u001b[67Gms\u001b[70Gfor\u001b[74Gallocations,\u001b[87Gdown\u001b[92Gfrom\u001b[97G90\u2013100\u001b[104Gms,\u001b[108Gsince\r\u001b[1B  page-fault c"]
